          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Su espíritu cruzó el canal hasta Maui, y oyó la música en la colina de Kaʻuiki, en Hāna.",
          "en": "Her spirit crossed the channel to Maui, and heard the music at Kaʻuiki hill, in Hāna."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero la música ya se había ido al oeste. La siguió hasta Molokaʻi, y después hasta Oʻahu.",
          "en": "But the music had already moved west. She followed it to Molokaʻi, and then to Oʻahu."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llegó al cabo de Kaʻena, la punta de Oʻahu que señala hacia Kauaʻi.",
          "en": "She reached Kaʻena Point, the tip of Oʻahu that points toward Kauaʻi."
        }
