        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Allí vivía un viejo llamado Pōhakuokauaʻi, la roca que Māui había arrancado del mar hace mucho.",
          "en": "There lived an old one named Pōhakuokauaʻi, the rock Māui had pulled from the sea long ago."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡Así que eres tú el que me engaña con esa música!», gritó Pele. «¡Te voy a matar!»",
          "en": "\"So it is you, fooling me with this music!\" shouted Pele. \"I will kill you!\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡No soy yo!», dijo el viejo. «Escucha: viene de allá, del mar.»",
          "en": "\"It is not me!\" said the old man. \"Listen: it comes from out there, from the sea.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Y era cierto. Los que tocaban eran dos espíritus chiquitos: uno vivía en una flauta de nariz, y el otro, en un silbato.",
          "en": "And it was true. The players were two tiny spirits: one lived in a nose flute, the other in a whistle."
        },
        {
          "es": "Querían llevar a Pele hasta un lugar donde se bailaba hula.",
          "en": "They wanted to lead Pele to a place where a hula was being danced."
        }
      ],
